/Title (now in perfect condition, with the running tracks being clearly chalked and prepared for fast sprints. The excitement is at a peak among all the different year groups; even those students who are not taking part are out in the sun, practicing in unison to perform perfectly during the opening ceremony. The show is further enhanced by the fact that the school's well-disciplined NCC team has been carrying out tough drills and is ready to take charge of the field with a sharp, synchronized demonstration of precision and pride.)
